<title>SPAIN: Spain June M4 rises provisional 0.2 percent.</title>
<headline>Spain June M4 rises provisional 0.2 percent.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain gave the following figures:</p>
<p> MONEY SUPPLY		    JUNE 97    MAY 97    JUNE 96</p>
<p> M4 pct rise			 0.2	 8.5	   4.1</p>
<p> Domestic credit pct rise     10.3	11.3	  10.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Percentage monthly rises are on annualised basis. Revised figures for previous months will follow later.</p>
</text>
